    diagnosticsKeepRuns: 'Keep what the helpers were told',
    diagnosticsKeepRunsHelp: 'Each helper run (a character, the record keeper, the suggestions) keeps its instructions, what it was asked, its tool calls and its result, for the latest 60 runs. Open a run in the activity list to see why it said or wrote what it did. The texts include what the characters know in private, so leave it off unless you are looking for a problem.',
    scheduleEnabled: 'Characters keep to their days',
    scheduleEnabledHelp: 'On by default. The characters who have a daily routine are where it puts them and sleep when it says so, and what you do can take them off it for a while (they pick it up again at the next change in their day). Off, nobody keeps a routine or sleeps, and nothing moves by itself: for a story whose characters have no days to keep.',
    autonomyEnabled: 'The story goes on while I am away',
    autonomyEnabledHelp: 'Off by default. On, and with the real clock, the characters keep to their days while you are not in the chat (they are where their routines have them, and the story knows it when you come back) and may write to you. It costs model requests while nobody is reading, and stops by itself after the limit below until you write.',
